flowchart LR
    A[Use-Case Intake<br/>problem + value hypothesis] --> B[Risk Classification<br/>scored, tiered]
    B --> C[Architecture and<br/>Data-Flow Review]
    C --> D[Security and<br/>Privacy Review]
    D --> E[Controlled Pilot<br/>read-only first,<br/>30-day baseline]
    E --> F[Measure vs.<br/>Pre-Committed Criteria]
    F --> G{Decision}
    G -->|Approve| H[Production<br/>tiered controls]
    G -->|Revise| E
    G -->|Stop| J[Documented Stop<br/>a governance success]
    H --> I[Continuous Monitoring<br/>quarterly access review]
    I -->|scope change or incident| B

